# Security

- All media HTTP routes require authentication (+ throttle); optional `VMEDIA_ABILITY`.
- Uploads: allow-listed MIME only; reject `../` in client filenames; sanitize relative paths (`UploadGuard`).
- Delete/open only vault-owned image/video collections.
- Do not serve private disks as public URLs without intentional visibility.
- Companion builder aliases must keep the same auth middleware as `vmedia.*` routes.
